#
# crates/libopus-prebuilt-sys/build.rs downloads the asset for the target it
# is building for and verifies it against the checksum here *before*
# unpacking it, so bytes nobody pinned never reach a linker. Re-pin after
# every release; a stale file is a build error naming this script, not a
# silently wrong library.
